/**
 * @component ComparisonAreaChart
 * @layer 2
 * @depends theme-seed
 * @description Two-layer area chart — billed versus collected. The current
 * period is a stroked area; the comparison period is the same geometry at
 * reduced opacity underneath it (H5), never a second axis. Hand-authored SVG
 * over the series cycle, with a CSS-only crosshair readout (H4).
